// The Stockade: a timber yard, and everything in it burns.
//  - The barn in the middle: a brick roof on eight plank posts and a plank beam. Fire climbs the
//    posts and runs round the beam; once the last post goes, the whole roof comes down on whoever
//    is under it (enemies and players alike).
//  - A watchtower in each corner: plank legs, a deck, a boulder on top. Burn or break the legs and
//    the deck drops with its boulder.
//  - Hay bales and woodpiles for cover: hay catches at a spark and passes it on.
